{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3f333711-c5df-83fe-b5a5-24cbbadc2b27",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:16:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:14:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. Um, I am looking for the Naval base housing office? Is this that office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, hon, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. The Navy housing office is a separate thing, it's on the base itself. Who were you trying to reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:14:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Housing office, at the base. I have a paper from them. I dial the number on the paper, but maybe I dial wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's possible. Do you want to read me the number you dialed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:15:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I dial four-oh-one, and then the other numbers. But the paper, it has a different start, I think. Two-oh-two? [pause] Is that the same area code? I do not understand. Rhode Island is four-oh-one, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Rhode Island is four-oh-one. If your paper has a different area code at the front, that might be a different office somewhere else, or it could be an older paper. Either way, you'd want to dial exactly what's printed on it. Is there a name of the office on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:15:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says Naval Station Newport, housing. Then the number. I see now, maybe I skip the first three numbers. Sorry, my eyes are not so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:15:49-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to be sorry at all. I can't give you the base number myself, I don't have it in front of me. Your best bet is the paper, or the base main line, they can connect you to housing. You could also ask someone at the gate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:16:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The paper, I will look again, slowly. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:16:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. You sound like you've got a project going, I hear something in the background."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, yes. I am building a bookshelf from a kit. The instructions, they are very confusing. Pictures only, and the screws, they look all the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:16:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, those are the worst. Take your time with it, and lay all the pieces out first, that always helps me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, okay. I will do that. Thank you, you are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Good luck with the housing office, and the bookshelf. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:16:43-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
